OL,3,GNEWSATeenager dies after disturbance in
OL,4,AGlasgow
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager has died after a disturbance
OL,7,Fin Glasgow.
OL,9,FThe 17-year-old boy was found injured
OL,10,Ffollowing a disturbance on Ashgill
OL,11,FRoad, in the city's Milton area, about
OL,12,F18:05 on Wednesday evening.
OL,14,FEmergency services attended but he was
OL,15,Fpronounced dead at the scene.
OL,17,FA 22-year-old man has been arrested and
OL,18,Fpolice enquiries into the incident are
OL,19,Fongoing.
